{"des":"火龙山径的迁徙-博物系学生塔丽互动","script":"s_5_9_1","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]非常感谢你们！我们的主力部队刚刚已经把熔火元素都驱逐出去了，现在我们可以重新建立营地了。[l][cm]","charaName":"博物系学生塔丽"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0.4,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]没事，能帮上忙就好。如果还有什么需要的话……[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]唉，光赶走一次有什么用啊，过几天那群家伙肯定就会卷土重来的，这几年都是如此！[l][cm]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]老爸！你还好吗？刚才你一个人跑到野外这么久没回来，我还担心你出什么事了呢！[l][cm]","charaName":"博物系学生塔丽"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]放心吧，我能出什么事。跟那群家伙打了这么多年交道，我身上还是有不少自保手段的。[l][cm]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]裴裴霍先生，可以详细说说熔火元素的事情吗？你们遇到什么麻烦了？[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]啊，几位契约者也出手干掉了些熔火元素吧，非常感谢你们。至于熔火元素的这个事……说来话长。[l][cm]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]当时这里还是一片火山地带，熔火元素均匀分布在这片土地上。然而当冰雪降临后，为了躲避严寒，熔火元素不得不离开家园，纷纷向南迁徙。[l][cm]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]起初在温度尚可时，熔火元素的活动范围尚未发生太大变化。但随着近年来气温骤降，南迁的熔火元素数量激增，大部分营地被毁都是它们所为。[l][cm]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]呃……那你们避开他们迁徙的路线扎营不就行了？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这件事没那么简单。首先，迁徙的路线千千万万，我们无法预知它们会从哪条路出现；其次，火龙山径是关键的交通要道，来往行人众多，绝不能轻易放弃这条路线。[l][cm]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]能否想办法让它们从其他路线南迁呢？[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]可以是可以，但我们也没法规划它们南迁的路线啊，总不能跟它们商量吧。[l][cm]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_15"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]其实要引导它们避开火龙山径也不是没有办法，那就是将山路彻底封死，迫使它们改道南迁。不过这样的话就得炸山封路，我们手头的炸药可不太够。[l]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_16"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_17","text":"炸山不行的话，试试炸雪如何？"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_17"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]炸雪？你的意思是……[l]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_18"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_19","text":"用低成本的炸药引发雪崩。"},{"tag":"tag_19","text":"用雪堵住山路。"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_19"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]这倒是个好主意……不过所谓的低成本炸药是什么样子的？[l]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_20"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_21","text":"我们来做一个寒冰爆桶吧。"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_21"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]还真的可行吗！那可太感谢了！[l][cm]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_22"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]请按你的说法，弄一个寒冰爆桶，我们来试试威力。如果能成功的话，我一定会给两位丰厚的报酬，拜托了！[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"秘学系教授裴裴霍"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_23"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}]}